license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/johnson7788/calibrated-signature-audit"
abstract: >-
  An open-source toolkit and protocol for auditing omics signature claims,
  including a size-matched gene-set permutation calibration that restores
  false-positive-rate control, a graded verdict taxonomy, a half-sample
  protocol, and cross-cohort replication matrices.
keywords:
  - signature audit
  - gene-set permutation
  - reproducibility
  - omics
